Resource Description Framework Schema (RDFS)
• RDF provides the model and syntax for describing resources, but it
does not define the meaning of those resources.
•RDFS comes in place by adding vocabulary and associated semantics
to RDF data model
• Classes and sub-classes
• Properties and sub-properties
•RDFS used to describe simple ontology (lightweight language), with
some primitives from OWL